+| **KAN-341** | `[KB-REDTEAM-10] Enforce Strict Upper Bounds and Timeout Clamping on Monte Carlo Simulation Parameters in Flow Telemetry` | Medium | Domain 7 (Concurrency) | `KAN-79` |
